# 🧪 SauceDemo QA Automation Tests (Playwright)

This repository contains 5 automated end-to-end (E2E) browser tests for [saucedemo.com](https://www.saucedemo.com), written using **Playwright** and **TypeScript**.

## 📋 Test Coverage
The automated test suite covers the following 5 critical user flows:
1. **Successful Login:** Verifies a user can log in with valid credentials.
2. **Login Failure:** Verifies the error message appears when using an incorrect password.
3. **Add to Cart:** Verifies a product can be added and the cart badge updates.
4. **Checkout Flow:** Verifies a user can complete the full checkout process.
5. **Log Out:** Verifies a user can successfully log out via the side menu.

## 🛠️ Prerequisites
Before running the tests, ensure you have the following installed:
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) (LTS version recommended)

